    "issue": {
      "title": "DynamoDB query reports the wrong ScannedCount",
      "description": "DynamoDB Table.query currently reports the size of the entire table as\nScannedCount, even when a query evaluates only one partition or one page.\n\nMake ScannedCount represent the number of items evaluated by the current\nquery page before non-key filtering. Do not count unrelated partitions or\nitems skipped before an ExclusiveStartKey. Preserve key-condition, index,\nlimit, pagination, ordering, projection, filtering, and LastEvaluatedKey\nbehavior.\n"
    },
